msgctxt "92"
msgid ""
"When are they gonna finish building that resort in Okinawa? Summer's just "
"around the corner!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"I think they've still got a ways to go. They haven't even passed the "
"military expansion bill yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"Huh? What's a military base got to do with a luxury resort? Why can't they "
"just build the thing and be done already?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"That's 'cause there are still people living on that land. Construction can't"
" start until they're up and gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "Why don't they just make them leave?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "It's not that simple..."
msgstr "Non è così semplice."

